{"id":"vod_sn_39151","vodId":"39151","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"钻石王牌","name_cn":"钻石王牌","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3a60c5e9704b739a4b41191447430979.jpg"},"summary":"国中毕业之后，热爱棒球的少年泽村荣纯（逢坂良太 配音）准备放弃理想，和朋友们一起在家乡的高中完成学业，然而，此时，泽村却收到了青岛高校棒球社副社长高岛礼（内山夕实 配音）的邀请，邀请他加入棒球队。要知道，青岛高校可是棒球远动员们心目中的圣地，无数前途无量的棒球选手们出自这所学校，泽村接受了这千载难逢的机遇。　　在球队里，泽村结识了一群志同道合的朋友们，心直口快大大咧咧的御幸一也（樱井孝宏 配音）、外表冷漠内心单纯的降谷晓（岛崎信长 配音）、身材矮小却实力强悍的小凑春市（花江夏树 配音）、看似腹黑却十分温柔的仓持洋一（浅沼晋太郎 配音），一行人为了完成称霸甲子园的梦想而不断挥洒着汗水，挑战着自我。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":75,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eMwYxQ6LP81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Mp5Ra8V0NL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LgKpvdSuni1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nkp03RqNUa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rBDDjmRYGt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TTcia2CjV71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rcqr216Z3M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E07iNJuRYZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DBpHKnDXMD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aav2ew0X5q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yUfgGaVGTM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YJSRkXppcw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xTF31EGKNC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HggTfSCu541/video/index.m3u8"},{